  "description": "The VMAX VX2 Lite is your entry into fully suspended riding comfort – reliable performance, strong safety features, and high-quality VMAX craftsmanship at an attractive price.\n\nFully suspended front and rear – oil pressure front fork, elastomer damping at the rear, for a noticeably smoother ride feel on cobblestones and uneven paths.\n\n500 W motor, up to 1400 W peak power – with V-Core 25A controller for controlled acceleration and a grade ability of up to 28%.\n\nThree range options – 50, 70, or 90 km, you choose what fits your daily routine.\n\nStrong safety package – turn signals front and rear, 60 LUX front light, brake light, drum brake, and electronic regeneration.\n\nIPX6 protection rating & app integration – weather-resistant for daily use, with the VMAX e-scooter app for iOS and Android.\n\nTechnical specifications: 10-inch tubeless tires · 48 V system · max. 130 kg load capacity · 21.9–23.5 kg weight depending on variant · aluminum frame.\nThe range applies under ideal conditions (20–25 °C, 75 kg rider weight, flat terrain, Eco mode). In practice, it may vary depending on temperature, weight, incline, and riding style.",
